# Dyadrine put onto the battlefield without being cast has had no mana spent to cast it, so "enters with a number of +1/+1 counters
# ... equal to the amount of mana spent to cast it" gives it none (CR 614.1c, 601.2h): Entomb puts it into the graveyard and Reanimate
# returns it as a 0/1 (X is 0 off the stack, so its mana value is 2 and Reanimate costs Bot1 2 life, CR 202.3e).

